16
00:00:35.101 --> 00:00:36.432
Eles querem saber o que faz

17
00:00:36.469 --> 00:00:38.130
Nosso cérebro geneticamente engenhado tick.

18
00:00:38.171 --> 00:00:39.934
Eles vão cortar nossas cabeças abertas

19
00:00:39.973 --> 00:00:41.099
E veja o que sai!

20
00:00:42.375 --> 00:00:43.706
